          <para>The system will NOT try to automatically store and enforce this policy again.</para>
          <para><format type="text/html"><a href="https://developer.android.com/reference/android/app/admin/PolicyUpdateResult#RESULT_FAILURE_HARDWARE_LIMITATION" title="Reference documentation">Android reference for <code>android.app.admin.PolicyUpdateResult.RESULT_FAILURE_HARDWARE_LIMITATION</code>.</a></format></para>
